Z||000000||jch82||03-29-2001||01:00 AM||||I have been looking at an 85GT and I want to know what you guys(and girls) think its worth...It has roughly 120,000mi and is a 4speed. There are a few electrical problems but I assume that is pretty common among fieros. <P><BR>This was original post<BR> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR><BR><B>85 Silver Gt Runs But needs Work</B><BR>I have a 85 silver gt 4 speed its runs but has some rod clacking the body is decent to good but the front has suffered a run in with a trailer hitch its crackeds and the paint is messed up a new nose and she's good as new tho I will try to get some pictures to send the interiors needs headliner and seats the rest is all there and decent needs some electrical work to get stero and passanger side windows working I belive this is a heck of a car but I just cant afford to fix er up She really has potential.<BR><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>And here is a link to the pics<P><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/jakejeckel82/85gt.htm" TARGET=_blank>Silver 85 GT Pics</A> <BR>Thanks<P>Josh  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR>Yeah, my girlfriend takes collect calls from the road<BR>And it doesn't seem to matter that I'm lacking in the bulge<BR>She laughs at my dumb jokes when no one does<BR>She brings me mexican food from Sombrero's just because<BR>                 <I>-Blink 182</I>||||reg||5
Z||000001||FieroLisa||03-29-2001||01:04 AM||||well how much restoration do you want to do? this car seems to need a bunch... too much for me, i wanted to just concentrate on making it look pretty instead of spending forever making it run.<P>remember there are lots of pretty darn nice fiero gts out there that arent too expensive as long as you are patient in your searching.<P><P>------------------<BR>Lisa<BR>86 violet pearl 4 speed GT- 17 in. rims, lowered, cold-air,<BR>AOL IM: FieroLisa<P><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/" TARGET=_blank>FieroLisa's Website</A><P><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ncfieros/" TARGET=_blank>Tarheels Fieros Website</A>||||reg||1
